# An allowlist: the server image builds from the Go sources alone. Disc
# images, save states, memory cards and the vanilla DOL must never reach a
# build context, so everything else stays out.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cheats/
!cmd/
!internal/
!mods/
!wwapi/

# Belt and braces inside the allowed trees (the patterns .gitignore keeps
# out of the repo).
**/*.iso
**/*.ciso
**/*.rvz
**/*.gcz
**/*.wia
**/*.nkit*
**/*.dol
**/*.sav
**/*.s0[0-9]
**/*.gci
**/*.raw
**/*.exe
